  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Wedding Guest Survey FAQ\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a wedding guest survey?\", \"a\": \"A wedding guest survey is a short questionnaire sent to the people invited to a wedding. Sent before the day, it collects their plans: which events they will attend, how they are traveling, and what they can eat. Sent after it, it asks guests to score the parts of the day they saw.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I create a wedding guest survey?\", \"a\": \"Describe the wedding in Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-survey-and-quiz-builder'>AI survey builder</a>: the events and what each vendor needs back from guests. Emergent builds the questions, the rules that decide who sees which one, and the table that holds every answer. When the plans change, edit a question with a follow-up prompt.\"}, {\"q\": \"What questions should I ask on a wedding guest survey?\", \"a\": \"Ask only what someone will act on. Before the wedding, that means the events each guest will attend, their arrival day, any dietary need, and a song request; leave the yes or no on attending to the invitation reply. After the wedding, ask how the day went for them and what they would change.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can a planner reuse one wedding guest survey for every couple?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Build it once, then prompt Emergent to swap in each couple's names and date, and keep each wedding's answers in its own table. There is no response cap in Emergent, however many weddings a season holds. A planning firm can build an <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-survey-and-quiz-builder/it'>IT survey</a> for its own office staff the same way.\"}, {\"q\": \"How should a wedding guest survey ask about food allergies?\", \"a\": \"With a pick list, not a blank box. Under federal law, the major food allergens are milk, egg, fish, Crustacean shellfish, tree nuts, wheat, peanuts, soybeans, and sesame, which makes a sound starting list. Add vegetarian, vegan, and an Other box. Then ask whether each need is an allergy or a preference, and pass that answer to the caterer with the guest's name.\"}, {\"q\": \"When should a couple send their wedding guest survey?\", \"a\": \"Send it with the invitations or soon after, and close it a week or two before the caterer needs a final headcount. That leaves room for one reminder, and for calling the last few guests yourself. A survey sent the week of the wedding arrives after the vendors have locked their numbers.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a wedding guest survey ask after the wedding?\", \"a\": \"Ask about the guest's own day, not the couple's choices: how getting there went, how the food was, and one moment they remember. Keep it to 4 questions and send it within a few days, as you would a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-survey-and-quiz-builder/post-purchase'>post purchase survey</a>, while the day is still fresh. Couples can add an open box for messages to them.\"}, {\"q\": \"Should a wedding guest survey be anonymous?\", \"a\": \"Before the wedding, no: the caterer needs a name and a table for every dietary need, and the planner needs names for the shuttle. After the wedding, leave names off the scored questions if you want guests to be frank about the food or the venue. Keep a separate, named box for notes to the couple.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do I remind guests to finish the wedding guest survey?\", \"a\": \"Set a reminder date in your prompt, and the app emails every guest who has not answered on that date. Add a second reminder a few days before the survey closes. Emergent builds the reminder emails from the same prompt as the survey. The list of guests still missing stays current as answers come in.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can a wedding guest survey collect mailing addresses for thank-you cards?\", \"a\": \"Yes. Add an address question near the end, with separate fields for street, city, state, and ZIP code. Split fields print cleanly on envelopes. Each address saves to a database you own, on the same row as the guest's other answers. Ask for it the way an <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-survey-and-quiz-builder/alumni'>alumni survey</a> keeps a mailing list current: once, with a box to confirm it.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
